; doomcc_core — the compiler (AGENT.md 1b): preprocessed C -> risc5_isa instrs.
;   Check    : the shared refusal channel (Unsupported) + ABI §4 banned-type checks
;   Frontend : goblint-cil parse + the RISC5 machdep (ABI §4, ILP32/LE/char-unsigned)
;   Globals  : static-storage placement + the data/bss image (3b data-layout embryo)
;   Fundec   : per-function compilation (leaves: straight-line, control flow, scalar globals)
; Depends on goblint-cil (the front end) and emu (Risc5_isa, the instr type we emit).
; The jig that exercises all of this lives in test/ (runner + test_jig).

(library
 (name doomcc_core)
 (libraries goblint-cil emu))
